# Notification for dropped operating system support.
# "{ -brand-short-name }" will be replaced with the localized name of the browser, e.g. "Tor Browser".
# "14.0" refers to the browser versions number: Tor Browser 14.0.
# "Windows" is a brand name, and "Windows 10" is the version.
dropped-support-notification-win-os-version-less-than-10 = La próxima versión de { -brand-short-name } (14.0) ya no admitirá esta versión de Windows. Actualiza a Windows 10 o posterior antes del 1 de octubre de 2024 para seguir recibiendo importantes actualizaciones de seguridad.
# Notification for dropped operating system support.
dropped-support-notification-dismiss-button = Entendido
# Notification for dropped operating system support.
# "{ -brand-short-name }" will be replaced with the localized name of the browser, e.g. "Tor Browser".
# "14.0" refers to the browser versions number: Tor Browser 14.0.
# "macOS" is a brand name, and 10.15 is the macOS version number.
dropped-support-notification-macos-version-less-than-10-15 = La próxima versión principal de { -brand-short-name } (14.0) ya no admitirá esta versión de macOS. Actualiza a macOS 10.15 o posterior antes del 1 de octubre de 2024 para seguir recibiendo importantes actualizaciones de seguridad.
# Notification for dropped operating system support.
# "{ -brand-short-name }" will be replaced with the localized name of the browser, e.g. "Tor Browser".
# "macOS" is a brand name, and 10.15 is the macOS version number.
dropped-support-notification-macos-version-less-than-10-15-expired = { -brand-short-name } ya no es compatible con esta versión de macOS. Actualiza a macOS 10.15 o posterior para seguir recibiendo actualizaciones de seguridad importantes.
# Notification for dropped operating system support.
# "{ -brand-short-name }" will be replaced with the localized name of the browser, e.g. "Tor Browser".
# "Windows" is a brand name, and "Windows 10" is the version.
dropped-support-notification-win-os-version-less-than-10-expired = { -brand-short-name } ya no es compatible con esta versión de Windows. Actualiza a Windows 10 o posterior para seguir recibiendo importantes actualizaciones de seguridad.
